Activate a draft metric

Usage: vendo metrics activate [OPTIONS] <metricId>

Arguments:
  <metricId>  

Options:
      --json            Output raw JSON
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics
  -h, --help            Print help

Examples:
  $ vendo metrics activate <metricId>
